          %h2#moduli_spaces Moduli spaces
          %p
            The notion of
            %strong
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+space"} moduli space
            is closely related to that of classifying space, but has some subtle differences. See there for more on this.
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %strong> classifying space
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+stack"} classifying stack
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+space"} moduli space
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stack"} moduli stack
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+moduli+space"} derived moduli space
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan-Thurston+theorem"} Kan-Thurston theorem
              %ul
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Milnor+classifying+space"} Milnor classifying space
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/numerable+bundle"} numerable bundle
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/acyclic+group"} acyclic group
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sullivan+model+of+classifying+space"} Sullivan model of classifying space
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+space+of+classifying+space"} free loop space of classifying space
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+topos"} classifying topos
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+principal+bundle"}> universal principal bundle
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+principal+%E2%88%9E-bundle"} universal principal ∞-bundle
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subobject+classifier"} subobject classifier
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+morphism"} classifying morphism
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p Original discussion of classifying spaces in topological homotopy theory:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Milnor"}> John Milnor
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Construction of Universal Bundles, II
                %strong 63
                3 (1956) 430-436 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1970012"}> jstor:1970012
                rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Palais"}> Richard Palais
                , Section 2.6 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    The classification of
                    = succeed "-spaces" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi G
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
                %strong 36
                (1960) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://bookstore.ams.org/memo-1-36"} ISBN:978-0-8218-9979-3
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://vmm.math.uci.edu/PalaisPapers/ClassificationOfG-Spaces.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Palais_ClassificationOfGSpaces.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Milgram67
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+James+Milgram"}> R. James Milgram
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The bar construction and abelian H-spaces
                %strong 11
                2 (1967) 242-250 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/journals/illinois-journal-of-mathematics/volume-11/issue-2/The-bar-construction-and-abelian-H-spaces/10.1215/ijm/1256054662.full"}> doi:10.1215/ijm/1256054662
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+C.+McCord"}> Michael C. McCord
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classifying Spaces and Infinite Symmetric Products
                %strong 146
                (1969) 273-298 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1995173"}> jstor:1995173
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/journals/tran/1969-146-00/S0002-9947-1969-0251719-4/S0002-9947-1969-0251719-4.pdf"} pdf
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (using – and introducing –
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compactly+generated+weakly+Hausdorff+topological+spaces"} compactly generated weakly Hausdorff topological spaces
            %li#MacLane
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Saunders+MacLane"}> Saunders MacLane
                , Section 6 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Milgram bar construction as a tensor product of functors
                %em The Steenrod Algebra and Its Applications: A Conference to Celebrate N.E. Steenrod’s Sixtieth Birthday
                Lecture Notes in Mathematics
                = succeed "," do
                  %em 168
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0058523"} doi:10.1007/BFb0058523
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BFb0058523.pdf"} pdf
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (understanding
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+realization+of+simplicial+topological+spaces"} geometric realization of simplicial topological spaces
                  via a
                  = succeed "-formula)" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coend"} coend
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Graeme+Segal"}> Graeme Segal
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classifying spaces and spectral sequences
                %strong 34
                (1968) 105-112 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/PMIHES_1968__34__105_0/"}> numdam:PMIHES_1968__34__105_0
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Norman+Steenrod"}> Norman Steenrod
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Milgram’s classifying space of a topological group
                %strong 7
                4 (1968) 349-368 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(68)90012-8"}> doi:10.1016/0040-9383(68)90012-8
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jim+Stasheff"}> Jim Stasheff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em H-spaces and classifying spaces: foundations and recent developments
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic Topology
                %strong XXII
                Univ. Wisconsin, Madison, Wis., 1970), Providence, R.I.: American Mathematical Society (1971) 247–272
            %li#tomDieck74
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tammo+tom+Dieck"}> Tammo tom Dieck
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the homotopy type of classifying spaces
                %strong 11
                (1974) 41–49 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01189090"}> doi:10.1007/BF01189090
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (relating the plain and fat
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+realization+of+simplicial+topological+spaces"} geometric realization of simplicial topological spaces
                  appearing in Milnor’s and Milgram’s constructions)
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li#Dwyer2008
              %p
